{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/aa76e81158fe602a74afb1fae28ec179.poster.avif?t=1766926438\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/aa76e81158fe602a74afb1fae28ec179.webm?t=1766926438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/aa76e81158fe602a74afb1fae28ec179.mp4?t=1766926438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragga-Dagga</strong> is a <strong>medieval fantasy</strong>\u00a0<strong>top-down action roguelite</strong> that heavily focuses on fast-paced melee combat. Discover runes and armor that'll grant you abilities to aid you on your glorious journey. Interact with NPCs who may offer special, unique events that may reward you with something cool in return! Fight hard bosses and enemies as you traverse through these abysmal dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/61a4b29db00f1ee0bacebbf7f4856795.poster.avif?t=1766926438\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/61a4b29db00f1ee0bacebbf7f4856795.webm?t=1766926438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/61a4b29db00f1ee0bacebbf7f4856795.mp4?t=1766926438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once upon a time, a dungeon doorframe that towers even mountains, suddenly appeared in the middle o